   "html": "<p>Universal once again trusted IHC to elevate their advance screening for M. Night Shyamalan's film 'Knock At The Cabin'. The result was night of excitement, creativity, and anticipation for the film's release.</p>\n<p>IHC brought our party expertise to transform the venue into a seamless blend of cabin aesthetics and ominous decor, perfectly capturing the movie's catastrophic events. </p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "party vibes",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Additional decor touches that nodded to the apocalyptic plot points from the film elevated the already existing forest and cabin aesthetic of the venue. Elements were added to theme sections of the venue to each tragedy. DJ Domo kept the energy high while guests, including Metro Boomin, got an axe throwing lesson by Mo herself! The Cobrasnake was present to capture all the good vibes. </p>"
    },
